I couldn't see the body of `statementLines`, so I renamed the existing method to a private `statementCore` and made `statementLines` call it. It then inserts one `Payment` line per payment, in recorded order, just above the line starting with "Paid". An invoice with no payments is unchanged.

I'm not sure of three things, because I couldn't see the code:
- The summary line really starts with "Paid".
- `formatPence` produces the `£250.00` form.
- `this.payments` keeps payments in the order they were recorded.

If any of these is wrong, the output will be off, so check the first one against the file.
